Great questions.

I will go through each of them.

The more psychic ability a person has the more likely they are to survive the hellscape.

If someone does not have morals like a say a serial killer they will experience a hellscape and the worse their morals are the less likely they are to survive and more hellish it is

Experiences the more bad someone has done they will experience worse situations.(I have not completed my drafts of all the differences.)

It is possible to survive as there is a survival rate of about 30% in the hellscape and a 95% rate of survival in the paradisaical versions.

The changes only happen if 4 or less people go in so it is completely normal if 5 people enter the building after the set time.

Lastly two items were discovered by citizens and 1 from a d-class exploration. One of these Items from the paradise version is a plant that never dies. One from the Hellscape version was a crystal that seems to make a person experience many deaths if touched. Lastly the one discovered by the D-Class was a brick that seems to exist and not exist simultaneously. None of these have anything in common so the foundation hopes to find something of use within the explorations.

There is much more to to this SCP and I hope to share.







